<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">FILEMƆ̃</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola Filemɔ̃</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemɔ̃</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola</para>
  <para style="mt">Filemɔ̃</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃swɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu eli ntam Pool. Ndɛ áyuɔɔl ndɛ ola Filemɔ̃ wu áli ɔ̃kiool wa bviil li Kolose bvool ndoo a ndɛ wu Pool (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). Onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, Pool asa ontwel b'ɔ̃nkyal ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuun Onedzime wu oyii ɔ̃kiool ke mbee a ŋ'étee Pool ndɛ Endɔɔ e Nziã. Onedzime áli ɔ̃nkyal a Filemɔ. Ndɛ ásiil nzɔ a mfam abal. Pool bu ámwɛɛn ye ndɛ onse bwal. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, Pool aluɔɔn Filemɔ̃ k'ayɔɔ Onedzime onge ndoo a dzi bvool adzeel ndɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool áswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu onse bwal sua mvel wu ãnku-ãsɛɛn ye yuaal (62) ke Lom, ŋ'ákuru ndɛ sa li ɛ̃kwel. Ndɛ ákel ɔ̃nkaan wu nkuul mɔ̃ ye wu ékel ndɛ Ebvɔɔn li Kolose. Mbuul wu ábiri myɛn éli Tiswike (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:7-9">Kol 4.7-9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, ke mbee a ŋ'ebio ntam Pool Filemɔ̃ ye b'akal ye ndɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ndɛ obveel Nziã atuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a dzii y'okiool o Filemɔ̃ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ndɛ bu ayɛɛn ndɔɔ yi esɔɔ ndɛ ola Filemɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a Onedzime (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ndɛ asɛɛl ɔ̃nkaan wu m'ɔ̃bio wa ntɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Me ndɔɔ akiool ba lio li, ɔ̃nkaan wu asuo epfuũ ki akiool ba lio li ɛ̃kwel me ndɔɔ a oyɛɛn b'otal onkyal. Pool atam Filemɔ k'asa ndɔɔ yi etam okiool o ndyam ndɛ osa, kwɛn obvɛ b'esa ndɛ, ndɛ asa bɔ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, ebee okal onge ndɔɔ yi eywɛɛn Pool ndɛ m'oywɛɛn. Ɔ̃nkaan wu asuo kal-a-kal kwɛn dzii li onse Yeso Mãsia ebveel ondoo onse akiool emfa e baal osuaal wɛ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ ndi mbuul a bwal me ndɔɔ a Yeso-Mãsia. Mɛ̃ ye ndoo a mɛ̃ Timote, bee eyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan wu ola yɛ wu Filemɔ̃, ndoo a bee wa dzii wu abesal ye bee. <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />Bee eyuɔɔl ndɛ hɛ̃ ol'Apya wu nkyel a bee, ol'Aaswipe, wu ndoo a bee wu eta, bvool ol'Ebvɔɔn li eli ebebvɔɔn onse nzɔ a yɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ye Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia asio byɛ nyiĩ, bvool awa byɛ opi!<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzii y'okiool o Filemɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Filemɔ̃, ãlio mbueel m'ebebuɛɛn mɛ̃, mɛ̃ k'ebeyɔɔl k'etuaal nkuũ a yɛ wɛ, bvool ebebveel Nziã a mɛ̃ ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a yɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ebeyoo baal abeyɛɛn me dzii li eli a yɛ me baal ba ngel bueel, y'okiool o yɛ me Mfam Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Mɛ̃ ebebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn okiool o bia-yɛ bo bvoo osal ye mpɛn onse yɛ, kwɛn bɔ osuul yɛ yɛɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ obvɛ bueel b'eli a bia bia-byɛ onse elaã e bia-byɛ li bvoo ye Mãsia. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Ndoo a mɛ̃ wa dzii, mɛ̃ ngyoo esɛ bibi bvool mbɔɔ mpɛn me ndɔɔ a dzii li eli a yɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn yɛ bweel ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ ba ngel.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndɔɔ yi esɔɔ Pool ola Filemɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, onkyam ŋɛn onse Mãsia mɛ̃ ndi ndii k'etam yɛ k'asa ndɔɔ yi ekoo, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />kɛn a me nkuũ a dzii, mɛ̃ mwɛn ngesɛ k'eluɔɔn yɛ, mɛ̃ wu Pool wu ngii ekukwel, bvel-bvel meba, mbuul a bwal me ndɔɔ a Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Mɛ̃ nduɔɔn yɛ me ndɔɔ Onedzime. Ndɛ wu oyii muaan a mɛ̃ onse bwal ŋã. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Ndɛ tsɔɔn k'áli y'otsɛn wɛ me ndɔɔ a yɛ, kɛn a meba ŋã, ndɛ oyii y'otsɛn bibi me ndɔɔ bia-yɛ ange-buaal. <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Mɛ̃ ebveel yɛ ndɛ, ndɛ wɛn meba oyii onge ɔ̃kwal a myam. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Mɛ̃ bam ékedzii k'étɛɛl ndɛ ola mɛ̃, kwɛn ndɛ awuaal a mɛ̃ ke mboo a yɛ, ŋe ndi mɛ̃ onse bwal me ndɔɔ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ k'edzii k'esa ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ wɛ yɛn, bia-yɛ k'ekuru yɔ wɛ, kwɛn obvɛ b'esa yɛ, yɛ sa bɔ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, ebee okal onge ndɔɔ yi eywɛɛn mɛ̃ yɛ m'oywɛɛn. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, owɛɛl ndɛ wu Onedzime ákab nzuru ye yɛ me muaan-lio, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ yɛ bvool yɔɔ ndɛ ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Meba, ndɛ k'abekal kɛn ɔ̃nkyal wɛ, ndɛ bam onduru ɔ̃nkyal. Ndɛ oyii ndoo a dzii wu ɔ̃tio, ke kɛn ola mɛ̃ wɛ, bvel-bvel ola yɛ, ekal onge mbuul, ekal onge ndoo onse Mfam. <verse eid="PHM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Oŋɔ̃ okɛɛn yɛ abewal mɛ̃ onge ndoo a yɛ, yɔɔ ndɛ, onge bɛn yɛ yɔɔ myam. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Okɛɛn ndɛ ási yɛ obi wuo oli y'ebiin e yɛ, suul kyɛ ekal nkal a mɛ̃. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool nswɛn ãndɔɔ mã me kuɔɔl e myam. Myam mbuul wu èfuru yɛ ebiin okyɛ. Mɛ̃ ke nzii k'eyeel yɛ wɛn yɛ hɛ̃ li y'ebiin e mɛ̃ wɛ, ebiin okyɛ ki elaã e yam. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Taa-taa, ndoo a mɛ̃, wuaal a mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ oyɔ onse Mfam. Suul ɔ̃kwal a mɛ̃ abva efyɛ me nkuũ a Mãsia. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Mɛ̃ nkel yɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã me yɛ wɛn yɛ àsa ndɔɔ yi nduɔɔn mɛ̃ yɛ, bvool mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn yɛ àsa m'ãnduru be ndieel mɛ̃. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Mɛ̃ bvool nduɔɔn yɛ wɛn faal mɛ̃ lɔɔ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã wɛn, me ndɔɔ ãbuɛɛn ã byɛ, ol' abveel mɛ̃ ola byɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃lɛɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafalas wu ndoo a mɛ̃ wa bwal me ndɔɔ a Yeso Mãsia, obio yɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Maak y'Alisitak, ye Demas, ye Luk b'andoo a mɛ̃ b'ɔ̃sal, abio yɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia asio byɛ nyiĩ!<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>